# cutlass_receipt's kernels, one cutlass_receipt_kernel.cu object each (job.sh's cgemm stage):
# name cfg var rounds p mode [spread [grain [extra]]]   (cfg 0 prefill, 1 decode; var 0 alu, 1 imad; L = 128 p / grain;
# mode 0 plain, 1 receipt, 2 dump, 3 extra only; spread 1 interleaves the receipt over the k-tile's four k-blocks; grain 2
# or 4 receipts every chain after every second or every 32-deep k-block; extra X adds a cheater's X alu phi1 steps a thread
# after every 32-deep k-block, on chains of its own)
